  "limits": [
    "The real Linux catalog ABI reports a nonzero result and an error string, without exporting the extended SQLite error code for its closed handle. The failure-layer syscall observed on both database paths was pwrite64(...catalog.sqlite-wal) = -1/ENOSPC.",
    "No physical drive was filled. A private Linux tmpfs exercises actual kernel byte/inode exhaustion, not APFS device writeback, unplug/reattach, ENOSPC during fsync, power loss or materialization of persistent Powerbox grants.",
    "Service filesystem/worker recovery contract tested independently of a SwiftUI retry action, photo encoder, model or signed production service. Throughput was not measured.",
    "The first plain/observed sequences predate the held-FD/foreign-final strengthening. The final observed receipt alone credits those added assertions."
  ]
